    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly, but I’ve used language tools like chatbots to clarify concepts when stuck. For example, I’d ask, ‘Explain quadratic equations using a knitting metaphor,’ and they’d adapt explanations dynamically. The high openness made me curious enough to experiment, though I prefer hands-on learning—AI feels like a co-pilot rather than a replacement.",
